<Slide
  notes={`（2:50–3:00）模块级仿真已闭环，图纸和 BOM 已出，材料基本到货，本周开始焊基带和载波板。下一步焊载波链、装天线调峰，再做接收和整机 6 m。汇报完毕。`}
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '60px 60px 0 60px', background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}
>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>
      进度、风险与下一步
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#DCDCDC', marginTop: 12 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 26 }}>
      <Image src='assets/fig_stage.png' style={{ width: 1160, height: 110 }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 24, gap: 40 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 560, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111' }}>已完成的工程化工作</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E6E6E6', marginTop: 12 }} />

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 26, fontSize: 15, color: '#1F4E79' }}>①</Text>
          <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>载波频率仿真收敛：零步长外推 30.9988 MHz，实物复验待进行</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 26, fontSize: 15, color: '#1F4E79' }}>②</Text>
          <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>名义工况电池预算约 304 mW，满足 0.5 W 限制；边界工况驱动电流需实测复核</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 26, fontSize: 15, color: '#1F4E79' }}>③</Text>
          <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>材料到货：LM393P、2N3904BU、OPA197IDR、BAT85S 已齐，基带与载波板可开焊</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#111111' }}>主要风险与未闭合项</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E6E6E6', marginTop: 12 }} />

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 26, fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F' }}>①</Text>
          <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>接收链未启动：OPA197 的 SOIC→DIP 转接板未到，LC 小件不齐</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 26, fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F' }}>②</Text>
          <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>天线已选定普通伸缩拉杆＋可调匹配＋地网，阻抗、损耗、匹配与辐射性能仍待实测</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 16 }}>
          <Text style={{ width: 26, fontSize: 15, color: '#D9534F' }}>③</Text>
          <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>调制度偏低：实际 m ≈ 27%，S05 按 50% 设计，v2 须按实际 m 重算</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 24, background: '#F7F7F7', borderLeft: '3px solid #1F4E79', padding: '14px 20px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#111111', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        下一步：焊基带与载波板并复验 → 装成品天线做 31 MHz 调峰 → 接收链实物 → 整机 6 m 实测
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 10 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8A8A' }}>31 MHz 模拟调幅无线方波传输系统　·　方案汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8A8A' }}>07 / 07</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
